{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_08_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_08","title":"滲透作戰","storyCode":"OD-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"17d731d45dfd34723f505fcde8ab0a9acb3cf067d4b464c9b818365d267b8e82","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lab"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這東西還在動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"炸彈部署完了，我們得撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"它......好像在重生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這東西......到底算什麼生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不管它是什麼，這東西都不應該存在於這個世界上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得撤了，要趕在炸彈爆炸之前跑出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"走這邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒子彈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我還在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你的情況看起來可不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老了，老了......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才沒躲開，小問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"現在怎麼辦？要去避難所嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"礦洞那邊，還沒消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也沒想到我們能堅持這麼久......不過也快到極限了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"弄一面盾牌，我其實早想這麼試試了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這就像是回到了過去，那些有關榮耀的美好時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕的巡林者們集結在鎮子的入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"明知道大軍壓境，明知道在戰爭之後他們中很多人都會血灑這片荒地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們有說有笑，高呼著戰歌，仿佛敵人是不堪一擊的蟲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭殘忍無情，有人退縮了，更多人決定死守到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"倒下的人成為了傳奇，站著的人負責銘記他們的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"最後站著的那個人，也慢慢開始畏懼死亡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他不想忘記那些倒下的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......也許是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"很榮幸和你並肩作戰，亞歷山大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很榮幸，巡林者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"不要這麼悲觀，我還沒有放棄戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是用砸的，也要敲死幾個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......那是什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是援軍！哈哈哈哈哈哈！我們得救了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這個手法......是那個年輕人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"我收到了求救信號，本來以為只是一次普通的救援任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有想到會在這裡遇到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"老遊俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你重操舊業了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老了老了，讓你看笑話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你的彎刀呢，遊俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"年紀大了，早就耍不動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"若不是你來，今天我這把老骨頭怕是要交代在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"你謙虛了，老遊俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊注意，目標在領主宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人是危險的變異源石生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"隨時彙報位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"當心點，它們數量很多，讓你的人儘量避免落單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，注意地下，它們會鑽洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"很榮幸與你並肩戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"“血色山谷的彎刀”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["ASH"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["BLITZ"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["TACHANKA"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
